# Fusion MS-WB670 (FUSION-LINK-1.0, sw 6.50.121) at address 51, captured on a
# Simrad/B&G NMEA 2000 backbone.
#
# This is an experiment, not passive observation: the two PGN 126720 commands
# come from address 200, which is our own canboat pipeline injecting them onto
# the bus -- no Fusion display originated them. Proprietary ID 15 ("Set
# Settings") writing FUSION_SETTING id 2 ("Zone 2 Linked"), first to 1 then
# back to 0. That the unit answers and obeys is what pins the layout.
# Each command is answered ~20 ms later by an unsolicited PGN 130820
# "Fusion: Setting" broadcast echoing the same id and value. The setting also
# takes effect: with Zone 2 Linked = 1 a fusionSetZoneVolume on zone 0 moves
# both zones, with 0 it moves only zone 0.
